  "faqHeader": "Have Questions? We Have Answers!",
  "faqQuestion1": "How do I book a car?",
  "faqAnswer1": "You can book a car by browsing our car listings, selecting a car that fits your needs, and following the checkout process to confirm your rental.",
  "faqQuestion2": "What documents are required for rental?",
  "faqAnswer2": "Typically, you will need a valid driving license, a national ID or passport, and in some cases, a credit card for the security deposit.",
